# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project:
# Settings → API → Project URL and the "anon / public" key.
#
# Leave these unset and the app still runs — it just falls back to
# localStorage-only, with no sync.
#
# The anon key is safe in the browser bundle; row-level security is what
# protects the data, not the key.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
